      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/geo/Point.html#getX()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.geo\"><code>Point.getX()</code></a> translates to longitude, <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/geo/Point.html#getY()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.geo\"><code>Point.getY()</code></a> to latitude.",
      "translation": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/geo/Point.html#getX()\" title=\"org.springframework.data.geo 中的类或接口\"><code>Point.getX()</code></a> 表示经度，<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/geo/Point.html#getY()\" title=\"org.springframework.data.geo 中的类或接口\"><code>Point.getY()</code></a> 表示纬度。",
