    {
      "source": "<a href=\"GeoJson.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.geo\"><code>GeoJson</code></a> representation of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/geo/Point.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.geo\"><code>Point</code></a>. Uses <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/geo/Point.html#getX()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.geo\"><code>Point.getX()</code></a> as longitude and\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/geo/Point.html#getY()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.geo\"><code>Point.getY()</code></a> as latitude.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"GeoJson.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.geo 中的接口\"><code>GeoJson</code></a> 表示法用于表示 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/geo/Point.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.geo 中的类或接口\"><code>Point</code></a>。它使用 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/geo/Point.html#getX()\" title=\"org.springframework.data.geo 中的类或接口\"><code>Point.getX()</code></a> 作为经度，以及 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/geo/Point.html#getY()\" title=\"org.springframework.data.geo 中的类或接口\"><code>Point.getY()</code></a> 作为纬度。",
      "count": 1
    },
