      "source": "the coordinates putting <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/geo/Point.html#getX()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.geo\"><code>x/longitude</code></a> first, and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/geo/Point.html#getY()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.geo\"><code>y/latitude</code></a> second.",
